    group {{ vpn_name }} {
      type external;
      neighbor {{ peer_ip }} {
        family inet-vpn {
          vpnv4;
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
{% endif %}
```

This approach lets the same logical service be deployed across devices with slightly different OS versions or feature syntax.

